\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
\textbf{\color{AshClay!80!black}獅子吼叫}，誰不懼怕呢？主耶和華發命，誰能不說預言呢？\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
A lion has roared! Who will not fear? The Lord GOD has spoken! Who can \textbf{but prophesy}?\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterStone} 阿摩司書 3:8 \textperiodcentered\ Amos 3:8
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 九章經文 \textperiodcentered\ 十二篇研讀 \textperiodcentered\ 五卷 \textperiodcentered\ 聲音先到，人才開口\\
\textit{Nine chapters of Amos in twelve studies \textperiodcentered\ five volumes \textperiodcentered\ The voice comes first; the prophet speaks after}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.5cm}p{1.9cm}p{6.7cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷} & \textbf{研讀篇} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一：吼聲與列國 & 1-2篇 & 吼聲先於先知；審判由外而內 \\
卷二：揀選與管教 & 3-4篇 & 只認識你們；五次管教，仍不歸向 \\
卷三：尋求與安逸 & 5-7篇 & 尋求我，就存活；安逸的人有禍了 \\
卷四：準繩與籃子 & 8-10篇 & 代求兩次蒙允，準繩垂下；聽的飢荒 \\
卷五：篩子與帳幕 & 11-12篇 & 一粒也不落地；倒塌的帳幕要重建 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一份別人的罪狀清單，是來聽一個聲音怎樣一圈一圈走到自己門前。\\
聲音先到；審判由外而內；尋求的門一直開著；最後的篩子，連一粒也不落在地上。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
Not a list of other people's sins: a voice that closes in, circle by circle, on the hearer's own door.
The voice comes first; the door stays open for those who seek; in the final sifting not one grain falls to the ground.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

